# Build artifacts / release packaging. Everything tools/release-mac.sh writes into
# dist/ is a signed artifact of one specific build (DMG, appcast.xml, deltas, the
# release-note copy Sparkle embeds); it is published to GitHub Releases / gh-pages,
# never committed — a stale committed appcast would point at a DMG nobody has.
build-device/
dist/*
!dist/README.md

# Acceptance screenshots carry real project names; they stay on the machine that
